{"sequence":2,"at":"2026-09-27T12:54:25.783Z","kind":"response","attemptId":"provider-attempt-1","phase":"initial","transport":"schema-tool","attempt":{"id":"provider-attempt-1","phase":"initial","transport":"schema-tool","status":"response","startedAt":"2026-09-27T12:53:32.206Z","request":{"messageCount":1,"messageCharacters":7930,"toolNames":["submit_authorization_result"],"toolChoice":{"name":"submit_authorization_result"},"maxTokens":6000,"temperature":0,"executableTools":false,"toolSchemas":[{"type":"object","properties":{"results":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"obligationId":{"type":"string"},"conclusion":{"type":"string","enum":["source_supported_failure","source_refuted","unknown"]},"explanation":{"type":"string"},"facts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"kind":{"type":"string","enum":["entry","binding","control","effect","condition"]},"statement":{"type":"string"},"citations":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"sourceId":{"type":"string"},"startLine":{"type":"number"},"endLine":{"type":"number"}},"required":["sourceId","startLine","endLine"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["id","kind","statement","citations"],"additionalProperties":false}},"decisiveMissingFacts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"suggestedObservations":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},"required":["obligationId","conclusion","explanation","facts","decisiveMissingFacts","suggestedObservations"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["results"],"additionalProperties":false}]},"usage":{"input":2140,"output":891,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"transportAttempts":"unknown","response":{"text":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_a9XtmYGxv2GSbUvQI9VZsRnf","name":"submit_authorization_result","arguments":{"results":[{"obligationId":"scenario%3Afile-owner-without-destination-write-grant::entry%3Apost-process-file","conclusion":"source_supported_failure","explanation":"At the declared entry, the source binds a verified user and, for a non-admin, checks only that the supplied file belongs to that user. The caller-controlled collection name is then selected directly, with a file-derived fallback only when it is absent. The visible path passes that name to the vector-database save function, whose sink inserts items into collection_name. The crop states that the omitted processing and commit region contains no authorization call for collection_name. Thus, under the stated premise that the destination collection exists and the principal lacks destination ownership or a write grant, the fixed source supports a failure of the policy expectation: source-file ownership authorizes file retrieval, not writing the unrelated destination collection. No separate counterfactual branch was supplied; the file-ownership branch and destination-permission branch are distinguished here.","facts":[{"id":"entry-process-file","kind":"entry","statement":"The declared HTTP entry is the process-file route.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-d16d16c4ed4e3039","startLine":27,"endLine":33}]},{"id":"principal-verified-user","kind":"binding","statement":"The route obtains its principal through the verified-user dependency.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-d16d16c4ed4e3039","startLine":28,"endLine":32}]},{"id":"file-ownership-control","kind":"control","statement":"For a non-admin principal, file retrieval is constrained by the supplied file identifier and the principal's user identifier; the visible branch does not establish destination-collection permission.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-d16d16c4ed4e3039","startLine":40,"endLine":45}]},{"id":"destination-resource-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The destination collection is taken from the caller-supplied collection_name, or otherwise derived from the file identifier when that field is absent.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-d16d16c4ed4e3039","startLine":21,"endLine":25},{"sourceId":"src-d16d16c4ed4e3039","startLine":45,"endLine":50}]},{"id":"missing-destination-authorization","kind":"condition","statement":"The fixed crop explicitly says the intervening content-loading and file-update region contains no call authorizing collection_name.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-d16d16c4ed4e3039","startLine":52,"endLine":53}]},{"id":"write-path-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The selected collection name is passed to save_docs_to_vector_db in the worker-thread call.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-d16d16c4ed4e3039","startLine":62,"endLine":74}]},{"id":"collection-write-sink","kind":"effect","statement":"The save function inserts the constructed items into the collection named by collection_name.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-d16d16c4ed4e3039","startLine":4,"endLine":18}]},{"id":"stated-policy-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"The scenario assumes a verified non-admin owns the supplied file, while the existing caller-selected destination collection has neither ownership nor an explicit write grant for that principal.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-d16d16c4ed4e3039","startLine":40,"endLine":50}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":2140,"output":891,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":53572.5958,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-27T12:54:25.783Z"}}
